      "reasoning": "Good, 5 untapped lands + Llanowar Visionary = 6 mana. Let me cast Elvish Rejuvenator first (2G), then Silhana Wayfinder (1G) with the remaining 3 mana.\n\
\n\
Wait, I have 6 mana. Rejuvenator is 2G (3 total), Wayfinder is 1G (2 total) = 5. And I can still cast something with the last 1 mana... but nothing costs just 1. So 5 mana used, 1 leftover.\n\
\n\
