      "reasoning": "Ivy Lane Denizen trigger — where to put the +1/+1 counter. Let me think about this strategically:\n\
\n\
- Ghirapur Guide (3/2 → 4/3): Better attacker, survives more\n\
- Silhana Wayfinder (2/1 → 3/2): Still fragile but more power\n\
- Llanowar Visionary (3/3 → 4/4): Great attacker\n\
- Ivy Lane Denizen (3/4 → 4/5): Big blocker\n\
\n\
I'll put it on Llanowar Visionary to make it 4/4 — it's my best attacker since it's not summoning sick. Actually, Ivy Lane Denizen isn't sick either. Let me think about combat:\n\
\n\
Opponent has Canopy Stalker 4/2 (must be blocked) that's sick, and Vampire Envoy 1/4 (tapped). I can attack freely with Ivy Lane Denizen and Llanowar Visionary.\n\
\n\
Putting the counter on Llanowar Visionary (4/4) gives me bigger attack. Or on Ivy Lane Denizen (4/5) makes the engine harder to kill. I'll go with Llanowar Visionary for maximum damage output.",
