      "type": "llm_response",
      "reasoning": "Roots of Wisdom milled some AMAZING cards — Elvish Warmaster, Might of the Masses, and Primeval Herald all went to the graveyard! But now I get to pick one back. Let me think:\n\
\n\
- **Elvish Warmaster** (1G): Creates 1/1 elf tokens when other elves enter, has a 5GG overrun ability giving elves +2/+2 and deathtouch. INCREDIBLE with Ivy Lane Denizen!\n\
- **Primeval Herald** (3GG, 4/4 trample): Searches for basic lands on ETB and attack. Great ramp but 5 mana and I already have plenty of lands.\n\
- **Skyway Sniper** (G, 1/1 reach): Already been there, can shoot flyers. Decent but weak.\n\
\n\
Elvish Warmaster is the clear pick! It combos with Ivy Lane Denizen (each elf that enters gives a +1/+1 counter), creates token armies, and has a game-ending overrun ability. This is the best card for my board state by far.",
