- Ghirapur Guide: 3/2\n\
- Silhana Wayfinder: 2/1\n\
- Wildheart Invoker: 4/3\n\
- Elvish Rejuvenator: 1/1\n\
- Llanowar Visionary: 4/4\n\
\n\
Total attacking power (non-sick creatures): 4 + 3 + 2 + 4 + 1 + 4 = 18. Opponent is at 10. That's more than lethal!\n\
\n\
