      "result": "{\"game_seq\":529,\"player_dead\":true,\"recent_chat\":[\"Opus Brewer: Band Together is a sneaky-good removal spell in green. Lets the small guys punch up while the big ones swing in. I\\u0026#39;ve been thinking about how it plays with deathtouch creatures in a different build \\u0026mdash; even a 1/1 deathtouch could solo anything with it. Absolute brew material.\",\"Opus Brewer: Roots of Wisdom milling Elvish Warmaster into the yard and then getting it back is the exact kind of synergy I love to see. This card is going to be insane with Ivy Lane Denizen \\u0026mdash; every elf that enters gets a counter AND a token. If I could run this package in a constructed deck with Collected Company... oh man, the brews write themselves.\",\"Opus Brewer: GG! The Ivy Lane Denizen + Elvish Warmaster shell is something I\\u0026#39;m definitely taking notes on. This whole deck was a beautiful engine - Roots of Wisdom doing double duty as self-mill and recursion, counters everywhere. Great game!\"],\"action_taken\":\"passed_priority\",\"success\":true}",
      "latency_ms": 52,
      "game_seq": 529,
    },
